    <main>
        <section id="features">
            <h2>Features</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Extract and understand text, tables, numbers, and key information from documents.</li>
                <li>Generate a clear and accurate summary.</li>
                <li>Identify the main ideas, important facts, dates, names, numbers, and conclusions.</li>
                <li>Extract key points and action items.</li>
                <li>Detect important risks, missing information, contradictions, and unusual data.</li>
                <li>Answer user questions about the uploaded documents using only the information contained in them.</li>
                <li>Allow users to compare multiple documents and identify similarities and differences.</li>
                <li>Generate summaries in different lengths: Short, Medium, Detailed.</li>
                <li>Support Arabic, English, and other languages.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section id="how-it-works">
            <h2>How It Works</h2>
            <p>Upload your document, and our AI-powered application will analyze it to extract and understand its contents. It will then generate a summary, identify key points, and answer any questions you have. You can also compare multiple documents to identify similarities and differences.</p>
        </section>
